  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lebanon Needs assessment of Older People</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of Lebanon needs assessment on older people is to understand the needs of older persons in 14 SDC catchment areas. This is to better understand the situation of older people with and without disabilities in each of the 14 SDC and adapt Qudra 2 project activities as needed.</narrative>
  </description>
